      "title": "Lock Milestone 1 input-boundary tests",
      "expected_end_state": "The codegen boundary is locked by verifier-clean local tests named vc4-codegen-emit-contract-*.mlir, and vc4-codegen rejects modules/functions/launch ABI/sink-op/thrend-epilogue violations with deterministic diagnostics.",
      "verifications": [
